---

This project is a Python reimplementation of the Domestia DMC-008 wire
protocol, originally reverse-engineered in Go by Victor Jacobs
(https://github.com/victorjacobs/go-domestia). That repository carries no
LICENSE file, so no explicit permission or license terms are being reused
here; only the (unprotectable) protocol knowledge -- the meaning of the
command bytes and frame checksum -- was carried over into this independent
implementation. If you are Victor Jacobs and have concerns about this,
please open an issue.
